# Shared feature sets the CA-1 pulls in (board/common/features/<name>/).
#   zigbee - EM35x NCP bring-up (zigbee) + zigbee-bridge, Zigbee to MQTT
#            + cp210x. The CA-1's NCP is on a native UART
#            (ttymxc4, DTR-reset), not USB, so cp210x just idles here.
zigbee
zwave       # zwave-bridge on the onboard ZM5304 (ttymxc3), or a USB stick
storage     # USB drives mounted and shared over SMB (storaged); no audio
            # playback here, so a network share only
